  m_text: "Up to 9 win lines can be selected per game.\nWins can occur across any
    of the win lines.\nAll line wins pay left to right only.\nFor a line win to be
    awarded symbols, or their substitute, must appear \non adjacent reels, beginning
    with the leftmost reel.\nWins on different played lines are added."
